    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::614410280",
      "Source": "If you see this text, please report what item it is on at the steam workshop page.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你看到这段文字, 请在Steam创意工坊页面报告这是什么物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3294578313",
      "Source": "Used internally, has no use to players.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"内部使用, 对玩家无用途。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::937631759",
      "Source": "A convenient method of taking this usually non-transferrable item with you when travelling across the ARK's!\r\n\r\nUse to get back the original item!\r\n\r\nNote: If nothing happens when using this item, the requested item either already is at max quantity in your inventory, or doesn't exist in your game files of your specific map. This is a failsafe to avoid losing any of the items when unpacking them. You won't lose the packed item in this case.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种方便的方法, 让你在穿越方舟时携带通常不可转移的物品!\r\n\r\n使用以取回原始物品!\r\n\r\n注意：如果使用此物品时没有反应, 要么请求的物品已在你的背包中达到最大数量, 要么在你特定地图的游戏文件中不存在。这是一种故障保护, 以避免在拆解它们时丢失任何物品。在这种情况下, 你不会丢失打包的物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1317810723",
      "Source": "- Snaps to foundations & ceilings.\n- Can toggle visibility of sides.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 吸附到地基和天花板。\n- 可以切换侧面的可见性。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3689178692",
      "Source": "Report this item on the steam workshop if you can read this text.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你能看到这段文字, 请在Steam创意工坊报告此物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2360265245",
      "Source": "Holds an immense amount of a single resource.\r\n\r\nCan store perishable resources, always acts as a fridge.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"容纳大量单一资源。\r\n\r\n可以储存易腐烂资源, 始终作为冰箱使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2287978290",
      "Source": "- Has advanced targeting features.\n\n- CHEAT version",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 具有高级瞄准功能。\n\n- 作弊版本","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::154514814",
      "Source": "A small box to display a Chibi.\n\n- Snaps to itself, foundations & ceilings.\n- Press G to disable snapping.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个用于展示迷你生物的小箱子。\n\n- 吸附到自身、地基和天花板。\n- 按G键禁用吸附。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::63959759",
      "Source": "Harvests nearby resources & Plant Species R. Can upload to dedicated storage (map wide).\n\nEquip a Dermis & a weapon to improve harvest quantity.\n\n** Can only be powered by a Tek Gen or battery **",
      "Trans": {"SC":"收获附近的资源和R异种植物。可以上传到专用储存(全地图)。\n\n装备皮肤和武器以提高收获量。\n\n** 只能由泰克发电机或电池供电 **","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::97911909",
      "Source": "A substance that can be used to make Kibble",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种可用于制作饲料的物质","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::167587273",
      "Source": "This very cheap, narrow foundation is used to build fences around an area.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种非常便宜的窄地基用于在区域周围建造围栏。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
