      "NamespaceHash": "CDAF59FD450B71DF0919358F3624F58E",
      "Source": "Cyber's Structures was developed with the same quality of life (QoL) improvements that made Structures Plus (S+) a staple in ARK: Survival Evolved. Building upon that foundation, it introduces an even broader range of enhancements designed to streamline gameplay, improve efficiency, and expand the creative possibilities for players in ARK: Survival Ascended.",
