    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4048224876",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Can be pin coded & locked\r\n- Place materials along with blueprints in this to create certain high-end machined items.\r\n",
