    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1439318385",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nMount this to throw destructive Boulders at your enemies, particularly effective against Structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可向敌人投掷毁灭性的巨石对建筑物尤其有效。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2135845611",
      "Source": "CS Frontier Lamps",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-西部风格的灯具","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2618583096",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA metal-encased oil lamp that lights and warms the immediate area. Comes it four variations.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With an option to not only configure the brightness and the sound on these lights, it also provides an option to auto turn on and off as well.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个金属外壳的油灯, 能够点亮并为周围区域提供温暖。共有四种不同的款式。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可以设置亮度和声音, 还配自动开关的功能。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3945911665",
      "Source": "CS Tribe Tower",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-部落塔","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2403073148",
      "Source": "CS Wasteland Lights",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-废土风格的灯具","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::575142843",
      "Source": "CS Steam Lights & Lamps",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-蒸汽风格的灯具","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3778607756",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to activate. Lights an area without adding much heat.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With an option to not only configure the brightness and the sound on these lights, it also provides an option to auto turn on and off as well.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要电力。可照亮一片区域, 不会产生过多热量。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可以设置亮度和声音, 还配自动开关的功能。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1506765017",
      "Source": "CS Multi-Tool",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-多功能工具","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::672163183",
      "Source": "A box with many tools in it...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个集成很多功能的小手枪...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::508798836",
      "Source": "CS Omni Tool",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-综合工具","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3712897499",
      "Source": "Hold Reload to open Mode Select UI",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个综合多种功能的小工具。\r\n\r\n按住<RichColor Color=\"0, 1, 1, 1\">R键</>键呼出轮盘菜单","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::593851056",
      "Source": "CS Campfire",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-篝火","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::282400358",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Can be pin coded & locked\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 可设置密码和上锁。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可支持远程调用制作。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3760476668",
      "Source": "CS Storage Box",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-储物箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2057789977",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA small box to store goods in.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个可以储存少量物品的箱子。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::230997750",
      "Source": "CS Thatch Doors & Window",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-茅草门 & 窗","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4037623099",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nEnough sticks budled together work as a simple door.  Can be locked for security, but is not very strong.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports auto opening and closing, with the ability to switch this to manual open or close, or total manual operation. Sound on the doors can also be turned down to your liking.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n茅草加工而成的门, 可以安放在门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可设置成手动开关门, 或是自动开关门模式。还可以调整开关门的声音噢。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3964508757",
      "Source": "CS Thatch Ceiling",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-茅草屋顶","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1445905611",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA thatched ceiling to protect you from the elements.  Not stable enough to build on.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n茅草加工而成的天花板, 可以安放在建筑物的顶部。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2440500051",
      "Source": "CS Sleeping Bag",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-睡袋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1948039508",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nThis hide sleeping bag acts as a single-use respawn point, only usable by you.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Admins can configure this to have shorter or longer cooldowns, and other options. Sleeping bags can also be configured to destroy on server start, or not to destroy when used.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n这个兽皮睡袋作为一次性使用的复活点, 只有你能使用。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">管理员可对其进行配置, 使用冷却时间, 以及其它选项。还可以设置为在服务器启动时销毁睡袋。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3814644993",
      "Source": "CS Mortar and Pestle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-研磨器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2179458928",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nThis simple stone contraption can be used to grind resources into new substances.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n这个简单的装置可以用来研磨资源转化为新的材料。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可支持远程调用制作。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2529227036",
      "Source": "CS Standing Torch",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-立式火把","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3678694174",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA torch on a tall piece of wood that lights and warms the immediate area.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports having the brightness turned down, or the sound turned off, as well as the ability to auto turn On at night, and Off when day rolls around.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个带有长管的火炬。可以提供照明和热量。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可调整亮度明暗和声音调节, 还具备定时开关的功能。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1159949696",
      "Source": "CS Simple Bed",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-简易床","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::642776123",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nThatch may not make the most comfortable mattress, but this bed acts as a respawn point for you and your tribe.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Admins can configure this to have shorter or longer cooldowns, and other options.</>\r\n\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n茅草垫子也许不是最舒适的, 但这个床可以作为你和你部落的复活点。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">管理员可对其进行配置, 使用冷却时间, 以及其它选项。</>\r\n\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3124214695",
      "Source": "CS Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-烹饪锅","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1698081023",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPut various ingredients with water in this to make soups, stews, and dyes.  Must contain basic fuel to light the fire.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将各种配料与水放入其中, 制作炖汤, 菜肴和染料。需要基本燃料才能点火。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可支持远程调用制作。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::10217598",
      "Source": "CS Small Crop Plot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-小型耕地","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4078408132",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA small garden plot, with a fence to keep out vermin.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Gardener, the Crop Plot can be auto tilled, and have the Greenhouse affect changed. Can also be configured to not to have the Greenhouse Requirement as well.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个小型耕地, 有一圈栅栏以防害虫进入。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Gardener, the Crop Plot can be auto tilled, and have the Greenhouse affect changed. Can also be configured to not to have the Greenhouse Requirement as well.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::520889346",
      "Source": "CS Wood Doors & Windows",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-木制门 & 窗","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1339939683",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA stable wooden door that provides entance to structures. Can be locked for security.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports auto opening and closing, with the ability to switch this to manual open or close, or total manual operation. Sound on the doors can also be turned down to your liking.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n木头加工而成的门, 可以安放在门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可设置成手动开关门, 或是自动开关门模式。还可以调整开关门的声音噢。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1012124108",
      "Source": "CS Wood Ceiling & Hatchframe",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-木制天花板 & 天窗框","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
