      "Source": "CS Converter",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-转换装置","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3689166504",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nConverts vanilla structures & blueprints to their CS counterpart and vice versa.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n能够让原版建筑与CS建筑之间互相转换。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::87272456",
      "Source": "CS Adobe Doors & Windows",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-黏土门 & 窗","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::284003762",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA stable adobe door that provides entrance to structures. Can be locked for security.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports auto opening and closing, with the ability to switch this to manual open or close, or total manual operation. Sound on the doors can also be turned down to your liking.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n黏土加工而成的门, 可以安放在门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可设置成手动开关门, 或是自动开关门模式。还可以调整开关门的声音噢。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1632383962",
      "Source": "CS Water Well",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-水井","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3828739389",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nThis stone tap allows access to the water in an irrigation network.  Can refill containers, irrigate crop plots, or provide a refreshing drink.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n石制水龙头, 供水网络的出水口。当供水网络中有水时, 可以在水龙头处直接饮用水, 也可以在水龙头中为水袋, 水瓶, 水壶装水。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1477552707",
      "Source": "CS Adobe Ceiling & Hatchframe",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-黏土天花板 & 天窗框","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3220714768",
      "Source": "CS Adobe Quarter & Triangle Ceiling",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-黏土小天花板 & 三角天花板","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2780144512",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA stable adobe-plated concrete ceiling that provides insulation, and doubles as a floor for higher levels.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n黏土加工而成的天花板, 可以安放在建筑物的顶部。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1651946337",
      "Source": "CS Large Storage Box & Bookshelf",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-大型储物柜 & 书架","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3493105466",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large cabinet to store goods in.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Bookshelf variant can also be connected to other Crafting Structures to allow for Wireless Crafting from Blueprint sharing.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个存放物品的大柜子。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">书架可以与其它制作建筑链接, 可实现蓝图共享远程调用。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
