      "Source": "CS Stone Water Tap",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-石制水龙头","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4142626893",
      "Source": "CS Wood Gate",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-木制恐龙门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::384076350",
      "Source": "CS Feeding Trough",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-饲料槽","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3485282411",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPut food for your nearby pets in this, and they'll automatically eat it when hungry!\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Max range is configurable up to a range of 100 foundations.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将食物放入其中, 附近的生物在饥饿时会自动进食!\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Max range is configurable up to a range of 100 foundations.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2478418077",
      "Source": "CS Preserving Bin",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-风干箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3864296473",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nBurns sparkpowder at low temperatures to dehydrate food and kill bacteria.  Keeps perishables from spoiling for a small time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n低温燃烧的引火粉可以给食物脱水灭菌。可以延长易腐品的保鲜期。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::159404017",
      "Source": "CS Metal Bookshelf",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属书架","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::942049749",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large reinforced bookshelf to store blueprints, notes, and other small trinkets in.\r\n\r\n- Metal Stength\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be connected to other Crafting Structures to allow for Wireless Crafting from Blueprint sharing.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个大型加固书架, 用于存放蓝图、书签以及其它小物件。\r\n\r\n- 金属材质\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be connected to other Crafting Structures to allow for Wireless Crafting from Blueprint sharing.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4155159940",
      "Source": "CS Crafting Station",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-铁匠台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1624653198",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPlace materials along with blueprints in this to create certain advanced forged items.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n把材料和蓝图放一起来制作某些高级的铸铁物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::227362519",
      "Source": "CS Refining Forge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-精炼炉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3637898700",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires Wood, Thatch, or Sparkpowder to activate.  Put unrefined resources in this to refine them.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要木头, 茅草或者引火粉点火。把未精炼的资源放入以炼化。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1047649872",
      "Source": "CS Wall Torch",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-挂壁火把","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1637386816",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA torch on a metal connector that lights and warms the immediate area. Must be placed on a wall.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports having the brightness turned down, or the sound turned off, as well as the ability to auto turn On at night, and Off when day rolls around.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个带有金属连接的可以照亮照暖当前区域的火炬。必须放在墙上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可调整亮度明暗和声音调节, 还具备定时开关的功能。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1195874037",
      "Source": "CS Stone Reinforced Doors & Windows",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-加固门 & 窗","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::716984387",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA reinforced wooden door that provides entrance to structures. Can be locked for security.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports auto opening and closing, with the ability to switch this to manual open or close, or total manual operation. Sound on the doors can also be turned down to your liking.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n木头加工而成的加固门, 可以安放在门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可设置成手动开关门, 或是自动开关门模式。还可以调整开关门的声音噢。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
