      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA stable brick-and-mortar ceiling that insulates the inside from the outside, and doubles as a floor for higher levels.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n石头加工而成的天花板, 可以安放在建筑物的顶部。","JA":""},
