      "Trans": {"SC":"木制巨兽恐龙门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3043902037",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large wooden gate that can be used with a Gateway to keep dinosaurs in or out.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n木头加工而成的恐龙门, 可以安放在木制恐龙门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
