      "Source": "CS Blueprint Maker",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-蓝图制作器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::75541902",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nConverts Structures, Armor, Ammo and Weapons to Blueprints. \r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Options are configurable to allow or not allow a conversion.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可将建筑、护甲、弹药和武器转化为蓝图。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Options are configurable to allow or not allow a conversion.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1867735773",
      "Source": "CS Dino Mindwipe",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-恐龙遗忘汤","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1300153419",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nGive this to any Tame, to reset the leveled points.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可以让已驯服的生物重新分配升级点数。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
