      "Source": "CS Medium Crop Plot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-中型耕地","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3809243469",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA medium garden plot, with a fence to keep out vermin.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Gardener, the Crop Plot can be auto tilled, and have the Greenhouse affect changed. Can also be configured to not to have the Greenhouse Requirement as well.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个中型耕地, 有一圈栅栏以防害虫进入。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Gardener, the Crop Plot can be auto tilled, and have the Greenhouse affect changed. Can also be configured to not to have the Greenhouse Requirement as well.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
