      "Source": "CS Fireplace",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-壁炉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1261853769",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA nice relaxing fireplace. Keeps a large area very warm and provides light.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个舒适的壁炉。可以给一大片区域供温度和光照。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可支持远程调用制作。</>\r\n","JA":""},
