      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4102293377",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nDeployable device to supply ammunition to nearby turrets.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可部署的设备, 为附近的炮塔提供弹药。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::113153542",
      "Source": "CS Ballista Turret",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-弩炮台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4115627675",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nMount this to fire large piercing Spear Bolts, useful for bringing down large dinos and structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可发射弩箭, 适合摧毁大型恐龙和建筑物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1426447645",
      "Source": "CS Hatchery",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-孵化巢","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3308275479",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Collects fertilized eggs (won't pick up eggs at or below 1% incubation)\r\n- Incubates eggs in its inventory (only incubates to 1%)\r\n- Boosts egg production of nearby dinos\r\n- Can use Power Generator or Re-Fertilizer for fuel (will automatically use fuel if no power is available)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 收集已受精的蛋 (孵化进度在1%及以下的蛋不会被收集)。\r\n- 在其物品栏中孵化蛋 (仅孵化到1%的进度)。\r\n- 提高附近恐龙的产蛋量。\r\n- 可使用泰克发电机为其供电或使用稀土肥料作为养料 (未供电时会自动使用稀土肥料)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::665670872",
      "Source": "CS Adobe Gate",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-黏土恐龙门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2012064706",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large adobe gate that can be used with a Gateway to most keep dinosaurs in or out.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个黏土恐龙门, 可以安放在黏土恐龙门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3506383183",
      "Source": "CS Display Case",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-展示柜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1224528023",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA small display case for Chibis & Cryopods\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Has the ability to place any Cryo's in here from all the major Cryo Mods.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n用于展示袖珍宠物和低温舱的小型展示柜。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Has the ability to place any Cryo's in here from all the major Cryo Mods.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::534173971",
      "Source": "CS Tree Sap Tap",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-树脂龙头","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::478040467",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nAttach this to a large tree to tap its sap over time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将其插进树木, 用以收集树脂。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::954159750",
      "Source": "CS Large Crop Plot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-大型耕地","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1460320364",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large garden plot, with a fence to keep out vermin.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Gardener, the Crop Plot can be auto tilled, and have the Greenhouse affect changed. Can also be configured to not to have the Greenhouse Requirement as well.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个大型耕地, 有一圈栅栏以防害虫进入。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Gardener, the Crop Plot can be auto tilled, and have the Greenhouse affect changed. Can also be configured to not to have the Greenhouse Requirement as well.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4264966532",
      "Source": "CS Beer Barrel",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-酒桶","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3916238585",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nFerments tasty brew from Thatch, Water, and Berries.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n用茅草, 水和浆果一起发酵来得到美味的饮料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3370486510",
      "Source": "CS Plant Species X Seed",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-X异种植物种子","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3142035254",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Has advanced targeting features.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Place into a Converter to be able to convert it from a vanilla Plant Species X seed.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 具有高级的瞄准功能。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Place into a Converter to be able to convert it from a vanilla Plant Species X seed.</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1876052710",
      "Source": "CS Adobe Behemoth Gate",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-黏土巨兽恐龙门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2174202076",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large, reinforced adobe gate that can be used with a Behemoth Gateway to keep dinosaurs in or out.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个加固的黏土巨兽恐龙门, 可以安放在黏土巨兽恐龙门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::737773724",
      "Source": "CS Metal Water Intake",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属引水口","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2254067323",
      "Source": "CS Gardener",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-园丁","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2554370395",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Collects crops from nearby crop plots.\r\n- Can place preserving salt in inventory.\r\n- Can use Generator or Beer for fuel (will automatically use fuel if no power is available)\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also acts as a water source for crops and other things that may require water. The Gardener can also Auto Till Crop Plots, and provide a buff to not require the Greenhouse, as well as having the ability to be configured as to how much it buffs the Crops.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 从附近的耕地中采集作物。\r\n- 可在物品栏中放置防腐盐。\r\n- 可使用泰克发电机为其供电或使用扎啤作为养料 (未供电时会自动使用扎啤)。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also acts as a water source for crops and other things that may require water. The Gardener can also Auto Till Crop Plots, and provide a buff to not require the Greenhouse, as well as having the ability to be configured as to how much it buffs the Crops.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3249106017",
      "Source": "CS Farmer",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-农夫","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3693458033",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Distributes fertilizer to nearby crop plots.\r\n- Will collect fertilizer from nearby compost bins and dung beetles.\r\n- Can use Generator or Calien Soup for fuel (will automatically use fuel if no power is available)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 可为附近的耕地输送肥料。\r\n- 从附近的蜣螂和肥料箱中收集肥料。\r\n- 可使用泰克发电机为其供电或使用卡琳汤作为养料 (未供电时会自动使用卡琳汤)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2252643477",
      "Source": "CS Nanny",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-保姆","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::849164060",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Gives food to nearby babies (under 10%)\r\n- Imprints nearby non-adult dinos\r\n- Can place preserving salt in inventory\r\n- Just requires power",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 可为附近成长值低于10%的幼崽喂食。\r\n- 可认养附近未成年的幼崽。\r\n- 可在物品栏中放置防腐盐\r\n- 需要供电才能使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3226855231",
      "Source": "CS Metal Water Tap",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属水龙头","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3263638593",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRefills containers & provide a refreshing drink. Requires nearby water tank or intake.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n为容器重新灌满以及提供可饮用的水。需要附近存在蓄水池或引水口。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4264109913",
      "Source": "CS Gas Collector",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-气体收集器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3316499140",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPlace on a Gas Vent to extract Congealed Gas Balls over time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n放置在气矿上提取冷凝的瓦斯块。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4267033202",
      "Source": "CS Greenhouse Ceiling",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-温室天花板","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3045321541",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA metal-framed, glass ceiling that provides insulation, and doubles as a floor for higher levels.  Excellent for growing crops indoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一种金属框制的玻璃天花板, 可提供隔热效果, 并可作为更高楼层的地板。非常适合用于建造种植室内作物的房间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1916568336",
      "Source": "CS Greenhouse Triangle Ceiling",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-温室三角天花板","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4177986987",
      "Source": "CS Greenhouse Doors & Windows",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-温室门 & 窗","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3784066761",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA metal-framed, glass door that provides entrance to structures. Can be locked for security.  Excellent for growing crops indoors.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports auto opening and closing, with the ability to switch this to manual open or close, or total manual operation. Sound on the doors can also be turned down to your liking.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一种金属框制的玻璃门, 为建筑物提供入口。为了安全起见, 可以将其锁定。非常适合用于建造种植室内作物的房间。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可设置成手动开关门, 或是自动开关门模式。还可以调整开关门的声音噢。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1382902630",
      "Source": "CS Metal Door",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1655882820",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA stable metal-plated concrete door that provides entance to structures. Can be locked for security.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Also supports auto opening and closing, with the ability to switch this to manual open or close, or total manual operation. Sound on the doors can also be turned down to your liking.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n金属混凝土加工而成的门, 可以安放在门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可设置成手动开关门, 或是自动开关门模式。还可以调整开关门的声音噢。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2804419771",
      "Source": "CS Metal Ceiling & Hatchframe",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属天花板 & 天窗框","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3137223102",
      "Source": "CS Metal Quarter & Triangle Ceiling",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属小天花板 & 三角天花板","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1489602698",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA stable metal-plated concrete ceiling that provides insulation, and doubles as a floor for higher levels.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n金属混凝土加工而成的天花板, 可以安放在建筑物的顶部。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::473617282",
      "Source": "CS Storage Metal",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属储物柜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1889064167",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large metal chest to store goods in.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n这是一个用来存放物品的大型金属箱子。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3960795097",
      "Source": "CS Power Generator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-发电机","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4065532832",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large machine that converts gasoline into electricity.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个可将汽油转化为电能的大型机器。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3829312880",
      "Source": "CS Industrial Grill",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-工业烤箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1690516875",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPerfect for cooking meat in bulk, staying warm, and providing light. Powered by gasoline.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可用于批量烤肉, 保温, 提供照明。需要汽油。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3807788366",
      "Source": "CS Wind Turbine",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-风力发电机","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1132769473",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nConverts the force of the wind into electricity.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将风能转化为电能。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3839540340",
      "Source": "CS Omnidirectional Lamppost",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-全向电灯","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::259719306",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to activate. Lights a large area without adding much heat.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be configured to be as bright or quiet as you need it, as well as having the ability to auto turn on and off when it is night or day.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要电力。可照亮一大片区域, 不会产生过多热量。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be configured to be as bright or quiet as you need it, as well as having the ability to auto turn on and off when it is night or day.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::106993295",
      "Source": "CS Lamppost",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-电灯","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::448538109",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to activate. Lights an area without adding much heat.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be configured to be as bright or quiet as you need it, as well as having the ability to auto turn on and off when it is night or day.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要电力。可照亮一片区域, 不会产生过多热量。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be configured to be as bright or quiet as you need it, as well as having the ability to auto turn on and off when it is night or day.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3469435769",
      "Source": "CS Cryofridge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-低温冰箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2196211298",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to run.  Keeps Cryopods alive forever!\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be configured to capture babies when an egg hatches.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要电力。可以让低温舱一直工作!\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can also be configured to capture babies when an egg hatches.</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3413242849",
      "Source": "CS Multi Lamp",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-短型全向灯","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2123058897",
      "Source": "CS Metal Gate",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属恐龙门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2866764297",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large metal gate that can be used with a Gateway to most keep dinosaurs in or out.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个金属恐龙门, 可以安放在金属恐龙门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2668852340",
      "Source": "CS Bunk Bed",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-双层床","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3292130886",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nThis modern bunk-style bed has two mattresses, and a high thread count.  Acts as a respawn point for you and your tribe with half cooldown time.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Admins can configure this to have shorter or longer cooldowns, and other options.</>\r\n\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n这种现代的双层床上有2个床垫, 用料考究。作为你和你部落的复活点可以减少一半的冷却时间。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">管理员可对其进行配置, 使用冷却时间, 以及其它选项。</>\r\n\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2307073762",
      "Source": "CS Metal Behemoth Gate",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-金属巨兽恐龙门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::382180353",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large metal-plated concrete gate that can be used with a Behemoth Gateway to allow even the largest creatures in or out.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个金属巨兽恐龙门, 可以安放在金属巨兽恐龙门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3557287180",
      "Source": "CS Refrigerator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-冰箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3387758301",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to run.  Keeps perishables from spoiling for a long time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要电力。可长期保存易腐品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::155253158",
      "Source": "CS Tek Hitching Post",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克栓龙桩","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4156822306",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nAllows nearby dinos to be hitched, preventing them from moving even when set to wander.\r\n\r\nHitched dinos will not go into stasis.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可将附近的恐龙拴住, 即便它们被设为巡逻状态, 也无法移动。\n\n被拴住的恐龙不会进入休眠状态。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2173227618",
      "Source": "CS Oil Pump",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-油井","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3100017984",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nExtracts Oil from an Oil zone\r\n\r\n- Can send oil back to CS Dedicated Storage.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n从油矿中提取石油。\r\n\r\n- 可将油传输回CS泰克专用储物箱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4125082068",
      "Source": "CS Air Conditioner",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-空调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1130367748",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to run.  Provides insulation from both the heat and the cold to an area of 750 insulation.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can be configured to provide extra insultation,  as well as a being able to configure it's range.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可给一片区域的生物提供750的冷热抗性, 需要电力。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可以提供额外的抗性, 并且能够调节其范围。</>\r\n\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3569053376",
      "Source": "CS Industrial Grinder",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-工业研磨机","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1597979160",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nGrind up crafted items and certain resources!\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports the ability to Autogrind armor and weapons etc. that is received from the Crystal Cracker, which can then also be sent to the CS Dedicated Storages.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n分解道具和部分资源!\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports the ability to Autogrind armor and weapons etc. that is received from the Crystal Cracker, which can then also be sent to the CS Dedicated Storages.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2320864073",
      "Source": "CS Auto Turret",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-自动炮台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1343735474",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to run.  Consumes bullets while firing.  Can be configured to automatically attack hostiles within range.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要电力。开火时需要消耗子弹。可配置攻击模式。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3386844861",
      "Source": "CS Item Aggregator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-物品调配器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3106734175",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Collects & distributes many items from & to many different things.\r\n\r\nRequires Tek Gen for power.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 从各处收集物品, 并将其调配到需要的地方。\n\n需要泰克发动机来供电。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::393573413",
      "Source": "CS Repulser Plate",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-弹射板","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1706825503",
      "Source": "Jumping on the plate will propel you a great distance.\n\nCan change direction & strength of impulse. When locked, can only be used by tribe and allies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"站在板上可以将你弹射出很远的距离。\n\n可以改变弹射的方向和力度。锁定后, 仅部落成员及盟友才可以使用。","JA":""},
      //可能会失效
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::252396991",
      "Source": "CS Domesticated Bee Hive",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-家养蜂巢","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::46222281",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nThis is an exceptionally friendly bee hive! \r\n\r\nProduces honey and waters nearby crops.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n这是一个非常友好的蜂巢!\n\n它能生产蜂蜜, 还能灌溉附近的庄稼。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3240214453",
      "Source": "CS Tek Tree Sap Tap",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克树脂龙头","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1309767033",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Larger inventory\r\n- More reliable sap production\r\n- Will send sap back to CS Dedicated Storage.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 更多的存放空间\r\n- 更高效的产出树脂\r\n- 可将树脂传输回CS泰克专用储物箱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1077591318",
      "Source": "CS Incinerator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-焚化炉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2519874421",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nDestroys anything placed in its inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n销毁放置在其物品栏里的任何物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::916223824",
      "Source": "CS Vault",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-保险柜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1340655665",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large metal vault to securely store goods in.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个大型金属保险柜。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::656496879",
      "Source": "CS Mini Vault",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-迷你保险柜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::870117599",
      "Source": "CS Industrial Forge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-工业熔炉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1483674144",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRefines resources in bulk. Powered by gasoline.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Item Aggregator, metal can be auto smelted and retrieved</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n批量精炼资源。需要汽油。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When used with the Item Aggregator, metal can be auto smelted and retrieved</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::614577096",
      "Source": "CS Chemistry Bench",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-化学实验桌","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1701424512",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPlace materials in this to transmute chemical substances with extreme efficiency!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n高效的转化各种化学物质!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3386552873",
      "Source": "CS Gacha Gavager",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-嘎查强制喂食器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::71570591",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nForce feeds one gacha.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Gachas fed this way are not saddened by being close to other gachas.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n强制喂食一只嘎查。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">使用这种方式喂食的嘎查不会感到不开心。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::699698400",
      "Source": "CS Personal Teleporter",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-个人传送门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2472562914",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nAllows instantaneous traversal between Teleporters! \r\n\r\n- Requires Tek Generator to power.\r\n- Teleport radius can be adjusted via radial menu.\r\n- Can be placed on saddles & rafts.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可以在传送门之前瞬间穿越! \r\n\r\n- 需要泰克发电机供电。\r\n- 传送半径可通过菜单调整。\r\n- 可放置在平台鞍和木筏上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3147320367",
      "Source": "CS Industrial Cooker",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-工业大锅","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1456464797",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nCooks large quantities of soups, stews, and dyes quickly.  Requires Gasoline or Power.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可快速烹饪大量的炖汤, 菜肴和染料。需要电力或汽油才能启动。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless Crafting.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2519592774",
      "Source": "CS Dedicated Storage",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克专用储物箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3961107549",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nHolds an immense amount of a single resource.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Can store perishable resources, always acts as a fridge. The amount that can be held inside is 10 times that of a Vanilla Tek Dedicated Storage.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可存储大量的一种资源。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">可以存储易腐坏的资源且具有的保鲜功能。其内部存储容量是原版的10倍。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::182282045",
      "Source": "CS Tek Storage",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克储物箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::683523058",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nSimilar size to dedicated storage but holds less of anything.\r\n\r\nWhen powered(tek gen), acts as a fridge. Reduces the weight of items inside.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n尺寸与泰克专用储物箱相似。\n\n当使用泰克发动机为其供电时, 具有冰箱的效果。能减轻其内部物品的重量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1809989780",
      "Source": "CS Tribute Terminal",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-贡品终端","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1787218141",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nConverts Element and other resources, that can be taken to another server without loss.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可以将元素和其它多种资源进行转换, 并且可无损地将其传输至其它服务器。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1156358843",
      "Source": "CS Dedicated Storage Interface",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克专用储物箱接口","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3897743256",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nUploads the inventory of a dino to CS Dedicated Storage (map-wide).\r\n\r\nOnly placeable on platform saddles & Stryders.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将恐龙配置的物品清单传输至CS专用存储 (地图范围)。\r\n\r\n只能放置在泰克跨步者或平台鞍上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::354374237",
      "Source": "CS Laboratory",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-化学实验装置","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2489395001",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nFunctions as a chemistry bench, can do resource conversions and make fertilizer.\r\n\r\nChemistry bench recipes output is doubled.\r\n\r\nRequires a Tek Gen for power.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n具有化学实验桌的功能, 还能将指定资源转换成化肥。\r\n\r\n化学实验桌配方产量是双倍。\r\n\r\n需要泰克发动机来供电。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2534241410",
      "Source": "CS Charge Injector",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-电荷注入器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2245028753",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nKeeps the Nameless at bay by injecting charge directly into the ground.\r\n\r\n- Adjustable range (charge usage increases exponentially with radius)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n通过向地面注入电荷来抵御无名怪。\n\n- 可调节半径范围 (电荷消耗量随半径呈指数级增长)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1130803630",
      "Source": "CS Drone Terminal",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-无人机终端","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::743503733",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nCrafts scouts & enforcers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n制作侦察机和执行者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3393115650",
      "Source": "CS Minigun Turret",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-机枪炮台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4158766242",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nMount this to fire a hail of Advanced Rifle Bullets at your enemies.  Powered by the rider.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可向敌人发射高级步枪子弹。需要驾驶员。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3669168609",
      "Source": "CS Crystal Cracker",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-嘎查水晶处理器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1728090745",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nAutomatically opens Gacha crystals placed inside.\r\n\r\nCan upload to dedicated storage on demand.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n自动开启放置在其物品栏里的嘎查水晶。\n\n可以根据需求传输至泰克专用储物箱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3177515987",
      "Source": "CS Dedicated Storage Intake",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克专用储物箱吸收器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1949466029",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nWill take items from you or your dino that have associated nearby dedicated storage units.\r\n\r\nCan be upgraded in size. (does not change distribution range)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n它会将部落成员或其恐龙物品栏中的相关物品传输至泰克专用储物箱。\n\n可改变尺寸大小 (但不会影响其范围)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1048429078",
      "Source": "CS Vivarium",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-生态箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::227823952",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPlace filled cryopods inside to generate unfertilized eggs, poop & many other resources.\r\n\r\n**Resources can only be collected by an CS Item Aggregator, they do not appear in the Vivarium's inventory**",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将装有生物的低温舱放入其中可产出粪便和未受精的蛋以及其它的资源。\r\n\r\n**所产出的资源只能通过CS物品调配器来收集, 不会存放在生态箱的物品栏中**","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::321635907",
      "Source": "CS Charge Station",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-电荷桩","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::17105041",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nWill draw charge from nearby light pets & vivariums that contain light pets.\r\n\r\nCan re-charge Charge Batteries. \r\n\r\nDoes not protect against nameless and can not craft element.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n它会从附近的光宠以及饲养光宠的生态箱汲取能量。\n\n可为蓄电池充电。\n\n无法抵御无名怪, 也无法制作能量元素。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2716804559",
      "Source": "CS Rocket Turret",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-火箭炮台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2895876970",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nMount this to fire Rockets at your enemies.  Powered by the rider.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可向敌人发射火箭弹。需要驾驶员。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2889895622",
      "Source": "CS Planetary Shield",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-生态保护罩","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::844498025",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nProtects the planet from meteors (Extinction & Genesis Lunar)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n保护当前生态免受陨石撞击 (灭绝 & 创世纪月球)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::850859202",
      "Source": "CS Element Catalyzer",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-元素转换器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::499253600",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nCrafts element but requires direct contact with liquid Element to function.\r\n\r\n- Recipe is the same as at a Charge Node except there is no cooldown.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可用于制作能力元素, 但需要与液体元素接触才能运作。\n\n- 制作能量元素的材料与在充电桩制作相同, 但没有它冷却时间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::371556292",
      "Source": "CS Heavy Auto Turret",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-重型自动炮台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4053411964",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires electricity to run. Provides increased firepower, but consumes FOUR bullets while firing.  Can be configured to automatically attack hostiles within range.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要电力。火力增加但是每次射击需要消耗四发子弹。可配置攻击模式。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::551777577",
      "Source": "CS Transmutator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-变体转换器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2471893525",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nConverts creatures between their variations.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将生物转换为其它不同的变体。不是变性别噢_(:з」∠)_","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4221379958",
      "Source": "CS Mutator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-突变器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2102731067",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nUnleashes the full power of element to alter dinos in powerful ways.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n释放元素的全部能量, 以强大的方式改变恐龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::125994726",
      "Source": "CS Transfer Control Unit",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-转移控制器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3241041081",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPerforms advanced transfers when activated.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n激活时执行高级转移的操作。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1191277598",
      "Source": "CS Auto Crafter",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-自动制作台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3584082635",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPlace another crafting station inside and this will automatically craft any recipe selected from the inserted crafting station.\r\n\r\n**Requires Tek Gen & does not give crafting exp**",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将要制作的物品材料放入其中, 它可以帮你自动制作预定好的物品\r\n\r\n**需要泰克发动机来供电。注意的是: 无法从中获取经验值**","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1368571051",
      "Source": "CS Healing Station",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-治疗桩","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3474790142",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nWhen home safe and sound, will keep the owner  refreshed and well fed. As well as giving a small boost in weight carrying.\r\n\r\nPowered by Medical Brews",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n当玩家满血状态在家时, 它能让玩家精神焕发、饮食无忧, 还能小幅提升玩家的负重能力。该设备需医疗药酒来供能。\r\n\r\n该设备需治疗药剂来供能。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3440060895",
      "Source": "CS Propagator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-培育器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4276119355",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nBreeds dinos from cryopods & produces eggs that display the stats/colors including which parent it was inherited from & any mutations.\r\n\r\nCan modify dinos gender, ability to breed & offspring mutations.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">When using Element, the Propagator is designed to give the best stats with mutations from the parents. Allows for better control on the breeding lines.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      //待翻译
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3892440249",
      "Source": "CS Tek Generator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克发电机","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::622964737",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPowers Tek Structures and electrical structures wirelessly! Requires Element to run, and Tek Engram to use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n为泰克建筑和电气设备提供无线电力! 运行消耗能量元素。\n需要先学会该泰克印痕技能才可使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1382395904",
      "Source": "CS Tek Trough",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克饲料槽","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3281052694",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPut food for your nearby pets in this, and they'll automatically eat it when hungry! Can refridgerate items, so long as it's powered by a Tek Generator!\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Max range is configurable up to a range of 100 foundations.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将食物放入其中, 附近的生物在饥饿时会自动进食! 若有泰克发电机为其供能, 则还有延长腐腐坏时间的功能。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Max range is configurable up to a range of 100 foundations.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2667338850",
      "Source": "CS Tek Replicator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克复制器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2945975331",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nPlace materials along with blueprints in this to create  Tek items, and many other items. Requires Element to run, and Tek Engram to use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n放入材料和蓝图以制造泰克及其他物品。运行消耗能量元素。\n需要先学会该泰克印痕技能才可使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4131428537",
      "Source": "CS Cloning Chamber",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克克隆机","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2675267289",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nEnables you to generate clones of your creatures!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n使您能够克隆你的生物!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4077945083",
      "Source": "CS Tek Ceiling & Hatchframe",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克天花板 & 天窗框","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3471873467",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nAn incredibly durable composite Tek ceiling that provides insulation, and doubles as a floor for higher levels.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n泰克材料加工而成的天花板, 可以安放在建筑物的顶部。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2726606586",
      "Source": "CS Tek Quarter & Triangle Ceiling",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克小天花板 & 三角天花板","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2233161514",
      "Source": "CS Tek Forcefield",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克力场护盾","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1846794883",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nGenerates an impenetrable, expandable spherical shield to keep out enemies. Requires Element to run, and Tek Engram to use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n生成一个无法穿透且可缩放的球形护盾。运行消耗能量元素。\n需要先学会该泰克印痕技能才可使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3827277570",
      "Source": "CS Tek Transmitter",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克传送器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1507735508",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nTransmits items, Survivors, and creatures to other ARKs! Requires Tek Engram to use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n传输物品、生存者和生物到其他方舟! 需要先学会该泰克印痕技能才可使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2828843850",
      "Source": "CS Tek Sleeping Pod",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克睡眠舱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3765039084",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nThis Tek-powered Chamber lets you rapidly recover vitals, and slowly gain XP even when sleeping. You can also sleep soundly within it, protected even while on a moving platform!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n这个泰克舱室可以让你快速回复生命体征并且缓慢增加经验值。即便在移动平台上使用, 它也能保护你的安全!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1883139201",
      "Source": "CS Tek Turret",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克炮台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1358519222",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nRequires Tek Generator power.  Consumes Element Shards while firing.  Has a variety of smart-targeting configuration options.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n需要泰克发电机供能。开火消耗元素碎片。拥有智能化设置选项。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2526240860",
      "Source": "CS Tek Elevator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克电梯","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::648473985",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nTeleports you up or down to other Tek Elevators.\r\n\r\nJump to go up, crouch to go down.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可将你上下传送至其他泰克电梯。\r\n\r\n跳跃即可向上传送, 下蹲即可向下传送。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1181624914",
      "Source": "CS Tek Forge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克熔炉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2436544905",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nInstantly smelts metal into ingots, wood into charcoal, organic polymer into polymer & condensed gas into gas balls.\r\n\r\nOnly requires 1 metal per ingot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可以瞬间将金属炼制成金属锭, 木材烧成木炭, 有机聚合物转化为聚合物, 以及将冷凝瓦斯压缩成冷凝瓦斯球。\n\n一个金属可以炼制一个金属锭。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::326670828",
      "Source": "CS Tek Stove",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克炉灶","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1497824189",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nCooks meat instantly and can make jerky.Requires Tek Gen for power.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可以瞬间烹饪出熟肉和熟肉干。需要泰克发动机来供电。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless crafting.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3527390777",
      "Source": "CS Tek Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克烹饪锅","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2825818827",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nCan make advanced recipes, kibble & beer. Produces twice the output of each recipe.\r\n\r\nPulls water from the air so doesn't need irrigation but requires a Tek Gen for power.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless crafting.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可以直接制作出高级食谱, 饲料以及扎啤。每个配方的产量都是双倍。\n\n该设备可以从空气中汲取水分, 无需灌溉, 但需要泰克发动机来供电。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Supports Wireless crafting.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2879154673",
      "Source": "CS Item Translocator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-物品传送器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3532170004",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nCan send items instantly to other item translocators.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可将物品即刻传送至另外一个物品传送器。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3262321560",
      "Source": "CS Tek Fridge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克冰箱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2329740039",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nCan fill water containers & resets the spoil timer of items placed inside.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n可以给容器充满水, 并重置放入其物品的腐坏倒计时。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2454405174",
      "Source": "CS Repair Station",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-维修台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::137553042",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nAutomatically repairs armor and weapons placed inside.\r\n\r\nRequires resources for repair to also be in the repair station.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n自动维修放置其中的护甲和武器。\n\n修复所需的材料也必须放置在该维修台内。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::287314829",
      "Source": "CS Tek Cloning Terminal",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-泰克克隆终端","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::817638040",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nAllows tames to be placed inside,allowing them to be cloned.\r\n\r\nJust add Shards.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n将已驯服的生物放入其中可进行克隆。\r\n\r\n需要放入元素碎片。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2447135682",
      "Source": "CS Stone Reinforced Behemoth Gate",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-加固巨兽恐龙门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3274553042",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA large, reinforced wooden gate that can be used with a Behemoth Gateway to keep dinosaurs in or out.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一个加固的巨兽恐龙木门, 可以安放在石制巨兽恐龙门框上。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">With the ability to auto open and close with configurable options , that allow the player to switch to manual or automatic, as well as being able to configure the sound options on the doors.</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1267462066",
      "Source": "CS Gravestone",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-墓碑","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2656145956",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nA simple unadorned stone headstone to mark a grave or commemorate a loved one.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Enables players to recover their dropped items upon death, ensuring that valuable resources and equipment are not permanently lost.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n一块朴素的石制墓碑, 用来插在坟头或者纪念所爱之人。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">玩家在死亡后能够回收掉落的物品, 确保珍贵资源与装备不会永久消失。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::987017777",
      "Source": "CS Item Collector",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-物品收集","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3159374186",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- Collects items that dino drop on the ground & produce in their inventory (also wool from sheep)\r\n- Distributes poop to Compost Bins & Dung Beetles\r\n\r\n- Can use Power Generator or Propellant for fuel (will automatically use fuel if no power is available).\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n- 收集恐龙掉落及其背包产出的物品 (包括绵羊的羊毛)\r\n- 将粪便分配至堆肥箱 & 蜣螂。\r\n- 可使用发电机供电或燃烧剂作为燃料 (无电力时自动消耗燃料)。\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::604118950",
      "Source": "CS Dino Leash",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-恐龙电子项圈","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::402683801",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\nElectronic leash to keep your dinos from wandering too far.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">Is twice the size of the Vanilla Dino Leash, for easier visability.</>\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"#00FFFF\">Cybers Structures</>\r\n\r\n电子项圈, 可以防止你的恐龙走丢。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,0,1\">尺寸是原版的两倍, 这样更容易看得清。</>\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3177443901",
      "Source": "CS Bladewasp Hive",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-刀蜂巢穴","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3221648266",
      "Source": "Transfer this Trophy and use it to unpack to Element",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将这个战利品打包叠加起来, 使用它获取元素。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3159463605",
      "Source": "A convenient method of taking this usually non-transferrable item with you when travelling across the ARK's!\r\n\r\nUse to get back the original item!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可让一些物品打包叠加起来, 使其变得更方便携带和存储以及可通过方舟来传输!\r\n\r\n使用后取回原物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3947530369",
      "Source": "Using Pull Selected on this item will pull resources for the selected recipe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为所选拉取所需的资源。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3355815504",
      "Source": "Doesn't require a water jar to craft and doesn't return one on use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不需要水瓶来装起, 喝掉后也不会返还水瓶。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1980403016",
      "Source": "CS Polymer",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS-聚合物","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::997075054",
      "Source": "Converts Organic Polymer to Polymer.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将有机聚合物转换成聚合物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
