      "Source": "**THE TOOLTIP IS INCORRECT, WILL USE ANY 2 GEMS(red, blue or green)**",
      "Trans": {"SC":"**提示信息有误, 可使用任意2颗宝石 (红, 蓝, 绿)**","JA":""},
