    {
      "NamespaceHash": "5D28BE7C48423F09FEFD46B1A4010776",
      "Source": "Dinos with an unknown level are in hibernation which also prevents knowing their exact location.\r\n\r\nEach entry can represent multiple dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"未知等级的恐龙处于停滞状态, 这也导致无法定位它们的准确位置\r\n\r\n每条记录可能代表多只恐龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3536413739"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "CC975B8045870EA3CBA0E297DC44038C",
      "Source": "CS Omni-Tool Info",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS综合工具说明","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"140613413"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "0AA9A7A7417F061F6575E0B56C3CD342",
      "Source": "Hold Reload Key/Button to open the mode select UI.\r\n\r\nBasic Transfer\r\n- Press Secondary Attack to set a structure as a source inventory.\r\n- Press Primary Attack to transfer everything from the source to the target.\r\n\r\nAdvanced Transfer\r\n- Primary Attack to open Transfer UI.\r\n- Secondary Attack to send presets to target Transfer Control Unit.\r\n\r\nInventory Assistant\r\n- Primary Attack to open Inventory Assistant UI.\r\n- Secondary Attack to toggle activation.\r\n\r\nDedicated Storage\r\n- Primaray Attack used to upload anything in your inventory to a Dedicated Storage.\r\n- Secondary Attack used when riding a tame, to upload to a Dedicated Storage.\r\n\r\nScanner Mode\r\n- Primary Attack to bring up the scanner, to scan for Wilds. Can also show the location and\r\n  stats for the wild.\r\n  ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按住\"R键\"按键来呼出轮盘菜单\r\n\r\n简单转移\r\n- 按下\"鼠标右键\"来将某个建筑设置为待转移的源库存\r\n- 按下\"鼠标左键\"可以将源库存的物品转移至待接收的库存\r\n\r\n高级转移\r\n- 按下\"鼠标左键\"打开转移选项界面\r\n- 按下\"鼠标右键\"将预设发送至转移控制器\r\n\r\n背包助手\r\n- 按下\"鼠标左键\"打开背包助手界面\r\n- 按下\"鼠标右键\"切换激活状态\r\n\r\n泰克专用储物箱\r\n- 按下\"鼠标左键\"将目标库存中的全部物品上传至对应的泰克专用储物箱\r\n- 按下\"鼠标右键\"将上传自己或骑乘生物的库存至对应的泰克专用储物箱\r\n\r\n扫描模式\r\n- 按下\"鼠标左键\"可以扫描野生生物, 也可显示野生生物的位置及属性信息","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"536666263"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "78390FF74BED22CC7B6C568876A49987",
      "Source": "CS Multi-Tool Info",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CS多功能工具说明","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3219695954"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "E0C168EE4F935D5CCD6344A7785F3D8D",
      "Source": "Hold Reload Key/Button to open the mode select Menu.\r\n\r\nSome modes have sub-modes which can be toggled with the Secondary Attack.\r\n\r\nStructure Mode \r\n- Sub-modes: Pickup and Demolish \r\n\r\nDino Mode\r\n- Sub-modes: Kill, Spay, Chibify, Toggle Mating, Toggle Ignore Whistles, Toggle Follow, Toggle Wandering, Toggle Creeping (whether dinos look at you) & Turret Mode, Capture mode\r\n\r\n(note: Chibify will destroy target and everything on it, also level & color of dino has no impact on the created chibi)\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按住\"R键\"按键来呼出轮盘菜单\r\n\r\n有些模式含有子功能, 可以通过\"鼠标右键\"来切换模式\r\n\r\n建筑模式\r\n- 子功能: 拾取和拆除\r\n\r\n恐龙模式\r\n- 子功能: 击杀, 绝育, 袖珍化, 切换交配, 切换忽视口哨, 切换跟随, 切换巡逻, 切换友军凝视 & 炮塔模式, 捕获冷藏\r\n\r\n(注意: 袖珍化会销毁该生物以及身上的物品, 而且恐龙的等级 & 颜色对袖珍化是没有影响的)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1284353364"}
    },
